  "bodyHash": "7c5cd3bc38d0af85",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>东方小女仆</h1>\n<p>这是一个适用于 Minecraft 1.16.5-1.20.1 Forge 的模组，灵感来源于 <a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a> 模组与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">东方Project</a>。<br>\n为 Minecraft 加入了可爱的女仆，她们可协助战斗、耕种及其他任务。<br>\n本模组支持基岩版实体（Bedrock Edition Entity）格式的自定义模型，你可轻松切换女仆模型，或自行创建专属女仆模型。</p>\n<h2>图片</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4ddb34836457d9b4daf1f72bd0f7cdad0da0953d.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eea50440aeeb0bea18858ee6afbf362a8f0f53e7.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8523790ba7c7abf66ba5cc315f6699277bf97761.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7493a33b9330b78b1ba228a1808d6d11a878635f.jpeg\" alt=\"女仆\"></p>\n<h3>视频</h3>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f1RlsOLinuis\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/1RlsOLinuis</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fxKowWaJCIYA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xKowWaJCIYA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2f8Eo2GM-a7iA\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/8Eo2GM-a7iA</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h2>注意事项</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>如有任何意见或建议，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">讨论区</a> 向我们反馈。</li>\n<li>如发现任何 Bug，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪</a> 提交 Issue。</li>\n<li>您可访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/TartaricAcid/TouhouLittleMaid/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">发布页</a> 下载快照版本模组，但请注意 <strong>快照版本模组可能极不稳定</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>作者</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>程序开发：<code>TartaricAcid</code>，<code>Snownee</code></li>\n<li>美术设计：<code>Succinum</code>，<code>Pajinyi</code>，<code>ZeniCrow</code>，<code>Tian_mi</code>，<code>Paulzzh</code>，<code>YurisCat</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>致谢</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MMM 与 Verclene：制作了 <a href=\"https://github.com/MMM666/littleMaidMob\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Maid Mob</a> 模组</li>\n<li>ZUN：创作了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fTouhou_Project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">东方Project</a></li>\n<li>音效资源源自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww14.big.or.jp%252f%257eamiami%252fhappy%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">あみたろの声素材工房</a></li>\n<li>LittleMaid PEKO 音效：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://booth.pm/ja/items/1903163&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>五子棋 AI：&lt;<a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/anlingyi/xechat-idea&amp;gt;</a></li>\n<li>所有以任何方式帮助过我的玩家，以及正在阅读的你</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>女仆 AI 聊天支持多种 AI 框架：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fplayer2.game%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Player2</a></li>\n<li>OpenAI</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>代码：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mit.edu%252f%257eamini%252fLICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT</a></li>\n<li>素材：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a></li>\n</ul>",
